{"meta":{"id":"tt7018010","type":"movie","name":"La misión de Santa","imdb_id":"tt7018010","description":"Llega la Navidad, pero Santa Claus se enfrenta a un completo desastre. Los 92 mil elfos que trabajan con él en su misión de llevar los regalos a los niños de todo el mundo han enfermado simultáneamente. La emergencia es total. Santa Claus no tiene elección y, en busca de aliados que le ayuden a preservar la magia de la Navidad, aterriza en pleno París. El choque de Santa Claus con el mundo moderno desencadena una imprevisible aventura.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt7018010.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uc369Ws3HHY4NXCgs2hwb5pjrGN.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kgrL36WHET05UIyh9tSLDAt8STP.png","genres":["Comedia","Fantasía","Familia"],"releaseInfo":"2017","released":"2017-12-06T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"100 min","imdbRating":"6.3","country":"France","cast":["Alain Chabat","گلشیفته فراهانی","Audrey Tautou","Pio Marmaï","Bruno Sanches","David Marsais","Grégoire Ludig","Johann Dionnet","Louise Chabat","Eléna Plonka","Mark Grosy","Kyan Khojandi","Tara Lugassy","Simon Aouizerate","Jean-Pierre Bacri","Mark Grosy","Audrey Giacomini","Ambre Larrazet","Stella Rocha","Xing Xing Cheng","Sissi Duparc","Nicolas Lumbreras","Paloma Coquant","Yann Frisch","Ian Fenelon","Gérard Graillot","Véronica Novak","Thomas VDB","Charline Paul","Zaven Najjar"],"director":["Alain Chabat"],"writer":["Alain Chabat"],"trailers":[{"source":"w9VwlDxQzWU","type":"Trailer","name":"Santa Claus & Cia. - Trailer español (HD)","ytId":"w9VwlDxQzWU","lang":"es"},{"source":"NnVXfBP-_D4","type":"Trailer","name":"Christmas & Co. / Santa & Cie (2017) - Trailer (English Subs)","ytId":"NnVXfBP-_D4","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"w9VwlDxQzWU","title":"Santa Claus & Cia. - Trailer español (HD)"},{"ytId":"NnVXfBP-_D4","title":"Christmas & Co. / Santa & Cie (2017) - Trailer (English Subs)"